      "type": "Session",
      "label": "Benchmark v3 proposal and the scrapy runs",
      "description": "Goal: Place a proposal to extend the benchmark, then run step 3 of #52 on scrapy.\nInstructions: Work on a separate branch; run the repetitions, then write the report.\nDiscoveries: The graph did not win on scrapy: code 0.99, cards 0.98, hybrid 0.97, graph 0.93, and the graph strategies were three to four times slower. The user doubted the graph helps models at all.\nAccomplished: #66 (benchmark v3) opened, depending on scrapy's results; status comment on #52; question categories; scrapy with 16 checked questions; runs of code, graph, hybrid and cards.\nNext steps: Repetitions and the report. The user asked for a checkpoint.md to resume the next day, but the session limit hit first: no checkpoint was written.\nRelevant files: bench/questions/scrapy.json, bench/repos.json, bench/results/20261019T213916Z-subagent-scrapy.jsonl",
